    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://codument-core/requirements/归档命令" } (
      <Requirement { id = "归档命令" } (
        <Statement ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE6>
        系统应当（SHALL）继续提供 archive 命令，并扩展为 spec、decision、memory、knowledge 的归档收敛入口。
        </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE6>
        <Suites [
          <Suite { name = "归档命令" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #archive-promotes-durable-artifacts { name = "Archive promotes durable artifacts" } (
