                track 已完成
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE7>
                <When ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE8>
                用户归档 track
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE8>
                <Then ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE9>
                系统按配置更新 `spec://`
                系统提升 durable decisions 到 `decision://`
                如 `projectMemory.enabled=true`，系统提升 durable memory 到 `memory://`
                如 `knowledgeSync.enabled=true`，系统执行或提示 knowledge sync
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWE9>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://codument-core/requirements/新结构必须对多分支协作友好" } (
      <Requirement { id = "新结构必须对多分支协作友好" } (
        <Statement ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEA>
        系统应当（SHALL）避免为 archive 和 memory 维护中心 `index.md`，优先通过追加新目录和 CLI 扫描降低冲突。
        </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEA>
        <Suites [
          <Suite { name = "新结构必须对多分支协作友好" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case { id = "多个分支同时产生-memory" name = "多个分支同时产生 memory" } (
                <Given ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEB>
                两个分支都启用了 project memory
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEB>
                <When ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEC>
                两个分支分别归档 track
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEC>
                <Then ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWED>
                各自创建独立时间前缀目录
                不修改共享 `memory/index.md`
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWED>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://codument-core/requirements/新结构必须保持项目中立" } (
      <Requirement { id = "新结构必须保持项目中立" } (
        <Statement ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEE>
        系统应当（SHALL）避免把某一类项目的 docs 目录结构写成 Codument 默认强制规范。
        </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEE>
        <Suites [
          <Suite { name = "新结构必须保持项目中立" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case { id = "生成-docs-knowledge-attractor" name = "生成 docs knowledge attractor" } (
                <Given ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEF>
                用户启用 knowledge sync
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEF>
                <When ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEG>
                系统生成默认 docs attractor
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEG>
                <Then ?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEH>
                attractor 描述 canonical/derived/implementation knowledge 的中立规则
                只把 Web、CLI、数据平台、编译器等作为示例
                </?01M02NT0W2JK6CDRA83D69FWEH>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
